{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"B1 RED complete: 25/25 tests collected and executed; 15/15 unit and 10/10 integration tests RED for intended absent behavior. Real Git 2.55 daemon advertises filter; current production-derived commands send no filter, transfer the historical >140 MiB blob, expose no guard, and lack identity object snapshots. Gate: default suite collects unit oracle; integration tier collects real-Git oracle. Holding out malformed-input unit cases and the entire integration/E2E file before standard-tier implementation."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785614788155782001,"uuid":"697476c6-1285-46b2-a74a-fdba4309fe1c"}